  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자유학기제에 맞추어 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기 수업은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1, 2, 5-1. 6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단원을 선택하였고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이번 기말 범위가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">5-1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">과 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단원입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학부모 공개 수업일에 뭘 하면 좋을까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">?’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리 반 아이들과 의논하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">진도로 보면 알코올램프를 사용하는 실험이 대부분이어서 고개를 가로젓더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 문득 떠오른 아이디어</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 흔한 슬러시 만들기를 하자</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">!’</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">궁리 끝에</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">통의 사이즈를 다음과 같은 것으로 선택하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">옆의 1.5L 페트병과 크기비교를 해 보세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/274A393C595473A708\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"506\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"통2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"506\"  id=\"A_274A393C595473A708E436\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그 통에 얼음 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1kg</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">을 넣고 온도를 측정한 다음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">굵은 소금을 뿌려서 온도를 다시 쟀더니 영하</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">20</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도 이하로 떨어졌어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이중지퍼백에 자신들이 원하는 음료</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">오렌지주스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">포도주스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">콜라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) 두 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">팩씩을 담아 통에 넣고 흔들거나 굴렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">너무 심하게 굴린 한 팀이 음료가 새어나와 얼음을 다시 받았어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.). </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">약 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">15</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분 후에 분단별로 슬러시가 완성되기 시작했습니다.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">기분 제대로 내보라고 슬러시용 컵과 슬러시용 빨대도 준비해 주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">얼음에 소금을 뿌리면 얼음이 녹지 않기 때문에 온도가 내려간다는 오개념을 갖고 있는 아이들이 있거든요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이번 수업은 융해열을 설명하는 참 좋은 탐구라는 생각이 들었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학부모 공개수업을 할 때면 어머님들도 모두 수업에 참여하고 보고서도 기록하도록 미리 안내를 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">매년 어머님들이 실험에 무지 열정적으로 참여하시고 보고서도 정확해요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.^^</span></p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사진 촬영은 못했어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">두 반 모두 분위기가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">excited state</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">… </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">경황이 없었답니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
